900 C1$="David spoke.":C2$="Susanna spoke.":C3$="The Devil King spoke.":C4$="The King of the North spoke."
1395 GOSUB 6250:BM$="It was dark outside the castle, stars dotting the sky. David looked around,\and his heart almost gave out from the shock.":GOSUB 5100
1400 BM$="`This isn't the garden,` he thought. `It's the same town from my nightmares...\Either I'm dreaming, or this is an illusion created by magic...`":GOSUB 5100
1410 GOSUB 9525:BM$="On the verge of a mental breakdown, David screamed at the empty town.":GOSUB 5100
1415 GOSUB 9515:BM$="As if to respond to his cry, a terrifying murderous intent swept over him.":GOSUB 5100
1420 ISET X:GOSUB 6260:GOSUB 9505:BM$="David was shivering, as if he had been bathed in cold water. He could not\stop there: he had to keep running through the town, before the source\of that bloodlust reached him.":GOSUB 5100
1430 BM$="He knew the way, as he had been in this town multiple times in his\nightmares.":GOSUB 5100
1440 BM$="`...If I go this way, the path turns to the left... And then it should go downhill...`":GOSUB 5100
1450 GOSUB 6270:BM$="`Then if I turn right, and take the next left downhill, I should get to a road\where you can see the castle...`":GOSUB 5100
1460 GOSUB 6280:BM$="`If it's like my nightmares, I should be able to reach the castle. The castle...\Come to think of it, it was very similar to Susanna's castle...`":GOSUB 5100
1470 GOSUB 6290:BM$="Forgetting about the threat hunting him, David ran through the town\from his memories.":GOSUB 5100
1480 GOSUB 6300:BM$="Then, across the wilderness, he could see the castle, in the distance.":GOSUB 5100
1485 ISET X:BM$="`Was the castle from my nightmares Susanna's castle? Was I fated to come\here...?`":GOSUB 5100
1490 GOSUB 9080:BM$="The moment he stepped into the wilderness, David felt dizzy.":GOSUB 5100
